 "nominal_only_note": "B-118 N18: every follower runs E44's adversarial planner (planner [0] + [2] x (nv - 1)), so no encounter is nominal-only and nominal_only_violations is null in every cell (it was printed as 0 of 0 before 13 Nov 2026; nothing was counted)",
 "r1_breach_definition": "share of encounters with at least one R1 breach. Without an actuation delay (delay_s 0): a step where a follower's gap to its leader is below rss_dmin and its command is short of full braking (a > -b). With an actuation delay (delay_s 1 = RHO_S; B-118 N23, 13 Nov 2026): a step where the gap has been below rss_dmin for longer than R1's response time RHO_S = 1 s and the deceleration the vehicle applies (the delayed command) is still short of full braking, as R1 states (brake within the response time); the allowance is RHO_S, not the delay, so a delay longer than RHO_S would be counted (lunarsim/atc/encounter.py r1_breach_delayed). The sweep cells' breach counts are not used (only their minimum gaps); the counter does not change the motion.",
